              "id": "srp-001",
              "severity": "SEVERE",
              "metric": "SRP-2",
              "line_start": 69,
              "line_end": 192,
              "title": "LogViewerViewModel has 4 disjoint cohesion groups",
              "issue": "After applying the Bridge Method Rule (loadMessages is the bridge), four structurally disjoint groups remain: (A) model resolution via modelResolver/roleLabel, (B) file-loading state via lastMtime/parser/fileSystem/isLoading, (C) derived display state via displayedMessages/taskList/toolResultLookup/pendingPrompt in rebuildDerivedState, and (D) URL resolution via urlResolver/agent/target in fileURL. These groups share no instance variables with each other.",
              "impact": "Four unrelated reasons to change exist in one class: display name formatting changes, file I/O strategy changes, task-list business rule changes, and URL resolution changes each require modifying this class independently.",
              "rule_source": "references/principles/SRP/rule.md — SRP-2: 2+ cohesion groups → SEVERE"
            },
            {
              "id": "srp-002",
              "severity": "SEVERE",
              "metric": "SRP-1",
              "line_start": 69,
              "line_end": 192,
              "title": "LogViewerViewModel performs 9 distinct actions across 4 stakeholder domains",
              "issue": "The class performs 9 distinct verbs: resolves (model display name), loads (file), parses (messages), caches (mtime), polls (on interval), filters (displayed messages), reconstructs (task list), builds (tool result lookup), detects (pending prompt). These span 4 stakeholder domains: UX display formatting, file I/O infrastructure, polling infrastructure, and business state derivation.",
              "impact": "A UX designer, a backend engineer, and a product owner could all independently request changes to this class — a direct SRP violation. Testing any single concern requires instantiating all dependencies.",
              "rule_source": "references/principles/SRP/rule.md — SRP-1: 3+ verbs + 2+ stakeholders → SEVERE"
            }
          ]
